# Pinned versions and checksums of the tools the pipeline downloads.
# This is the ONLY place to change when a tool is updated.
# Checksums come from the release's *_checksums.txt file:
#   https://github.com/anchore/syft/releases/download/v<ver>/syft_<ver>_checksums.txt
#   https://github.com/anchore/grype/releases/download/v<ver>/grype_<ver>_checksums.txt

